  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Saqqummeriffissaq akiaaluunniit suli aalajangersarneqanngillat.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude Claude Code-illu Anthropic, PBC-p pigisaannut kingornussaapput. Unreal Engine Epic Games-illu Epic Games, Inc.-ip pigisaannut kingornussaapput. Blender Blender Foundation-ip pigisaanut kingornussaavoq. Quake III Arena Elite Dangerous-illu pigisaannut kingornussaapput. Atit tamarmik pigisaasa pigisaraat taakkuninngalu pisuussutit taaneqartut ilisimatinniarlugit kisiat atorneqarput. Orion-81 taakkununnga ataatsimulluunniit atassuteqanngilaq, ikiorneqarsimanngilaq akuerineqarsimananilu.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Neriuutaasoq. Suleqatigiinneq, atassuteqarneq akuerinerlu pigineqanngillat.",
